## Deployment Steps

1. Create VPC and networking components
2. Configure public and private subnets
3. Deploy NAT Gateway and route tables , Security Groups.
5. Configure IAM for access SSM and cloudwatch on Ec2.
4. Configure Launch Template for Ec2 instances. 
5. Launch Target Group, Application Load Balancer.
6. Configure Auto Scaling Group
7. Configure Amazon RDS
8. Configure AWS WAF
9. Enable monitoring using CloudWatch & SNS
10. Cnfigure Route 53
